{
  "_comment": "ABLATION of input_multitask_replay.json: identical in every respect EXCEPT the polymer branch's fitting is `polymer_additive` (project per atom, then weight by mole fraction) instead of `polymer_pool` (pool embeddings, then one head). Same shared DPA-3.3 descriptor, same energy replay branch, same data, same lr/steps. Diff this against input_multitask_replay.json to isolate the non-additive head. See README 'Additive ablation'.",
  "model": {
    "shared_dict": {
      "type_map_all": [
